   "text": "**H0110_L2_dag_vector_cancellation_and_fv_opt** · hypothesis\n\nDAG post-optimizer with algebraic cancellation (shortening residual u,v,w expressions via 64-bit hash tables of vector sums/differences from V_pool, composing independent u/v/w blocks across files of the same matrix format, and Boyar-Peralta cancellation reduction across _fv formats and all 49 exact-SOTA formats with max_dim<=8) will reduce cr below the live record on >= 3 formats.",
